      "text": "DEMOGRAPHIC WINDOW: period when both OADR and YDR are low\n  → minimum TDR → most favorable for savings and investment\n  → This is the demographic dividend opportunity (see 09-DEMOGRAPHIC-DIVIDEND)"
    },
