        "title": "Population Aging",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "ALTERNATIVE MEASURES:\n  Prospective age: \"prospective age 65\" = age at which remaining life expectancy\n    equals 15 years. This ages with mortality improvements.\n    If LE improves by 5 years, prospective age 65 shifts to chronological 70."
    },
    {
      "id": "06-AGING.md#020",
      "path": [
        "06-AGING.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
