        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Population Aging",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Economic support ratio: actual hours worked / actual consumption by age\n    (National Transfer Accounts methodology — Mason & Lee)\n    Captures both consumption behavior and labor force behavior.\n    More accurate than demographic ratios."
    },
